<title>USA: U.S. Bancorp authorized to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>U.S. Bancorp authorized to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Bancorp said Thursday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 7.5 million shares of USBC common stock, subject to market conditions.</p>
<p>As of September 30, the company had about 151 million shares outstanding.</p>
